    {
      "beat_id": "B01",
      "t_start": 0.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 10.0,
      "narration_text": "Salam. This is Liam, in for Bear. What is the fastest way to build a spreadsheet from scratch with AI? Cowork creates it, Google Sheets hosts it, and ChatGPT edits it — here is the exact workflow.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "COMPOSER_ASK",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "type",
        "scene_type": "ClaudeComposerAsk",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "ClaudeComposerAsk",
          "props": {
            "ask": "What is the best way to create a spreadsheet with AI?",
            "answer_preview": "The fastest path is Claude Cowork — it builds the actual file and...",
            "command": "What is the fastest way to build a spreadsheet from scratch with AI?",
            "greeting": "Salam. This is Liam"
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B01.mp4",
            "at": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "new_visual_element": "[COMPOSER] cold open ask + Liam sign-in",
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B01.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-09T20:55:20"
      },
      "actual_duration_s": 11.88,
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "t_start": 10.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 9.0,
      "narration_text": "Claude Cowork is the best tool for creating spreadsheets — not editing them, creating them. Open the desktop app. Click the Cowork tab at the top. Connect Google Drive. Select your working folder. That is the setup.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "REMOTION",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "hold",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "CoworkComposer",
          "props": {
            "typedText": "Open Cowork tab → connect Google Drive → select working folder",
            "heading": "Cowork creates. Not edits.",
            "subline": "Claude Cowork is best for creating spreadsheets from scratch.",
            "chips": {
              "scope": "Finance",
              "mode": "Research"
            }
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B02.mp4",
            "at": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "card": {
        "kind": "spark",
        "eyebrow": "CLAUDE COWORK",
        "copy": "Create, don't edit.",
        "sub": "Cowork tab → connect Drive → select folder",
        "accent": "#D97757"
      },
      "new_visual_element": "[SPARK] Cowork as creation tool",
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B02.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-09T20:55:20"
      },
      "actual_duration_s": 11.65,
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "t_start": 19.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 10.0,
      "narration_text": "The magic phrase in the prompt is: top ten assumptions to sanity check before execution. That single line keeps you in control. You are not just receiving output — you are approving the logic before Cowork builds the whole spreadsheet. That is the difference between a tool that helps you and one that runs away from you.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "REMOTION",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "hold",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "CoworkComposer",
          "props": {
            "typedText": "Top ten assumptions to sanity check before execution",
            "heading": "The magic phrase.",
            "subline": "One line keeps you in control — you approve the logic before Cowork builds.",
            "hint": "This phrase keeps you in control of the logic."
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B03.mp4",
            "at": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "card": {
        "kind": "spark",
        "eyebrow": "CLAUDE COWORK",
        "copy": "Top ten assumptions.",
        "sub": "Sanity-check phrase that keeps you in control of the logic",
        "accent": "#D97757"
      },
      "new_visual_element": "[SPARK] magic prompt phrase card",
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media/B03.mp4",
        "filled_by": "media",
        "at": "2026-08-09T20:55:20"
      },
      "actual_duration_s": 16.64,
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B04",
      "t_start": 29.0,
      "estimated_duration_s": 12.0,
      "narration_text": "Once Cowork has built the spreadsheet, export it to Google Drive with one click. It opens directly in Google Sheets — no conversion, no reformatting. From there you can share it with anyone. If you want to keep editing with AI, stay in Cowork and follow up with more prompts. Or move to Google Sheets and bring in the ChatGPT extension.",
      "shot": {
        "type": "REMOTION",
        "source": "own",
        "motion": "drawon",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "CoworkTaskView",
          "props": {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "prompt",
                "text": "Export to Google Drive and open in Sheets"
              },
              {
                "type": "toolline",
                "text": "Exporting to Google Drive…",
                "spinner": false
              },
              {
                "type": "toolline",
                "text": "Opened in Google Sheets — no conversion needed",
                "spinner": false
              },
              {
                "type": "cardgrid",
                "cards": [
                  {
                    "title": "Cowork",
