        "layout": "Horizontal flow with three boxes connected by right-pointing arrows. Box 1: 'Cowork' (create from scratch). Box 2: 'Google Sheets' (host and share). Box 3: 'ChatGPT extension' (edit with AI). Below each box: a one-line action label. Terracotta arrows between boxes."
      },
      "new_visual_element": "[ILLUSTRATION] three-tool spreadsheet workflow",
